+# 📦 external_tools/awesome-llm-apps — Reference Mount
+
+Backend library reference for the Awesome-LLM-Apps starter family.
+
+* **Reference mode** — `catalog.json` is a metadata-only index (10 starters:
+  RAG, multi-agent, browser-agent, YouTube summarizer, SQL agent, research,
+  eval harness, memory, workflow orchestrator, MCP tool server). No upstream
+  code is vendored or executed.
+* **RPC** — `rpc.py` exposes `StarterRPC.list() / .query(text) /
+  .run(id, agent, params)`; `run` returns a simulated receipt with planned
+  steps so swarm pipelines can wire starters natively.
+* Upstream: <https://github.com/Shubhamsaboo/awesome-llm-apps>
+
+The cross-reference engine deep-links this mount via its repo-template
+registry (`repo.awesome-llm-apps`).
