+# 🛰️ OMNIHACK // MISSION CONTROL v2.0
+
+**Maxed-Out Agentic Swarm Mission Control Center & Automated Social Media Factory
+with Live Remote Browser Streaming.**
+
+Cyberpunk command deck on Gradio 6: hierarchical agent swarm, universal
+Ollama + HuggingFace engine, live remote browser, 202-skill lab, embedded SSH
+terminal, workflow builder with 10+ brand connectors, hardware hub, Telegram
+remote control, 3 switchable HUD skins and a global emergency kill switch.
+Every external integration ships with a deterministic simulated backend — the
+app runs natively with zero credentials.
+
+## 🚀 One-shot install (single bash command)
+
+Paste this **one line** on any Linux VPS — clones, installs, launches:
+
+```bash
+git clone --depth 1 -b arena/01a0e419-flubber01-omnihack-suite https://github.com/flubber01/flubber01-omnihack-suite.git omnihack && bash omnihack/install.sh
+```
+
+(inside an existing clone simply `bash install.sh`; `--no-launch` installs only,
+`OMNI_PORT=8080` changes the port). Manual: `pip install -r requirements.txt &&
+python run_mission_control.py`
+
+## 🤖 Floating Help Bot
+
+A site-style assistant lives bottom-right on every console. It guides setup
+conversationally, step by step: type a keyword (`ollama`, `telegram`, `video`,
+`agents`, `install` …) or `topics` for the list, `next` to advance a guide,
+a number to jump to a topic. Hide it via **✕ HIDE** on the widget or
+permanently via **⚙️ Settings ▸ UI Cleanup ▸ Help Bot** toggle.
+
+## 🖥️ Multi-Screen Mode (2 monitors)
+
+One server, three views — open two of them and drag one to your second display:
+
+| URL | Screen | Content |
+|-----|--------|---------|
+| `/` | Full console | all tabs + settings |
+| `/ops` | **Operator console** | swarm chat + agent terminal, live browser, content factory |
+| `/wall` | **Monitor wall** | telemetry, ops matrix, log stream, hardware, browser peek (read-only) |
+
+## 🗺️ Tabs (main console)
+
+| Tab | Capability |
+|-----|-----------|
+| 🛸 Swarm Live Operations | streaming multi-agent chatbox, live ops matrix, **AGENT DIRECT TERMINAL** (`/help`, `/say`, `/status`, `/kill` …) |
+| 🤖 Agent Configurator | commander➔minion tree, editable system prompts, model binding, **Define AI's Job** intent compiler |
+| ⚡ Ollama + HF Engine | `/api/tags` scanner, **hf.co/Org/Repo-GGUF** pulls, local GGUF ➔ Modelfile, instant bind |
+| 🌐 Live Browser Stream | stealth viewport, click-capture ➔ coordinate injection, DOM dump, **Ollama autopilot**, noVNC fallback |
+| 🎬 Content Automation | wizard + **5 pre-configured pipeline presets**, one-click autopilot, planner |
+| 📡 Social Connectors | X/YouTube/TikTok/Spotify/Instagram/Facebook vaults · **4 seeded personas** (ALEX/MIA/LEON/SARA) · daemons |
+| 🔬 Skill Lab | 202 stubbed skills, fuzzy search, fuse/strip onto agents |
+| 🧠 Memory & Learning | **SQLite memory vault**, remember loop, lessons, self-improvement score |
+| 💻 SSH Terminal | paramiko shell (blank host → sandbox), quick-ops |
+| 🗺️ Workflows & Connectors | node sequencer, GitHub + Azure, **n8n · Kaggle · Gmail · Slack · Discord · Notion · OpenAI · Zapier · HuggingFace · Stripe**, 4 shipped blueprint pipelines |
+| 🔌 Hardware Hub | GPU/edge/NAS matrix, docker fleet, power telemetry |
+| 📊 System Logs | 2000-event ring buffer, level filter |
+| ⚙️ Settings & Config | **3 HUD skins**, **UI cleanup toggles** (hide unused controls), **Telegram bridge**, config.json export/import |
+
+## 🧠 Memory & Self-Improvement
+
+* **SQLite vault** (`data/omni_memory.db`): episodic / procedural / semantic /
+  feedback memories — filled automatically by swarm chat, content autopilot
+  and every skill execution.
+* **Remember Loop**: background thread that snapshots telemetry, consolidates
+  raw memories into reusable **lessons** and grows an **improvement score** —
+  arm it in the 🧠 tab (or run a cycle manually).
+* **Recall**: keyword-scored semantic search per agent/kind.
+
+## 🎨 HUD skins (live-switchable)
+
+* **MILITARY OPS** — olive/amber stencil console (default)
+* **JARVIS** — holographic Stark HUD, cyan/gold
+* **CYBERPUNK** — matrix green/magenta
+
+## 📱 Telegram control
+
+Settings ▸ Telegram: paste your **@BotFather** token, optionally whitelist
+chat ids, hit ARM. Then from your phone:
+
+```
+/status  /agents  /kill  /resume  /ping
+/short <topic>           → full content autopilot
+/say <AGENT> <msg>       → direct-talk any agent
+/skin <name>             → swap HUD style
+/nexus                   → API vault + free-pool status
+/xref <query>            → Hermes hub cross-reference lookup
+/forecast · /quant       → TimesFM forecast + quantum anomaly pipeline
+/billion                 → 1e9 grid footprint + bench
+/compute [cmd]           → Compute-Commander chat/status
+/streams                 → stream wall sessions + fps guard
+/dbal                    → DBAL registry + sync heartbeat
+/prompt <task>           → master→minion prompt dispatch
+/model                   → bound reasoning engine
+```
+
+## ⛔ Fail-safes
+
+* **EMERGENCY KILL SWITCH** (top bar + `/kill` + Telegram `/kill`) freezes
+  every agent, browser task, render loop and workflow instantly.
+* SSH sandbox blocks destructive patterns; credentials are never persisted.
+
+## 🕸️ API-NEXUS — zero-cost API supply engine
+
+Legitimate supply line for the agent army (no foreign credentials, ever):
+
+* **DBAL vault** — encrypted SQLite at `~/.omnihack/vault/api_nexus.db`
+  (auto-created). Stores the operator's OWN keys with format validation,
+  dummy-key rejection and rotation counters.
+* **Free pool** — bundled catalogue of 20 genuinely keyless public APIs
+  (weather, finance, geodata, media, utility) + operator-supplied
+  directories (OpenAPI specs / JSON lists) — endpoint metadata only.
+* **Health worker** — 120 s heartbeat cycle synced to the mission heartbeat;
+  probes endpoints, degrades/retires dead ones, re-checks key formats.
+* **Learning curve** — adaptive per-source weighting (`learning_metrics`).
+* **RPC for the swarm** — `NEXUS.request_asset(category, agent=…)` serves the
+  healthiest free endpoint first, else rotates operator keys round-robin.
+* **Defensive leak scanner** — scans YOUR OWN tree for accidentally committed
+  secrets and reports masked fingerprints for revocation (values never stored).
+
+```bash
+python3 api_nexus_harvester.py                 # boot + health cycle + stats
+python3 api_nexus_harvester.py --store <provider> <category> <key>
+python3 api_nexus_harvester.py --rpc <category> [agent]
+python3 api_nexus_harvester.py --scan <path>   # defensive leak scan
+python3 api_nexus_harvester.py --ingest <name> <url>
+```
+
+## 🧬 Cross-Reference Engine (Hermes 90k+ hub)
+
+Backend middleware only — **no frontend UI changes**:
+
+* **Hub DBAL** — 90 168 skills / 204 categories indexed lazily into
+  `~/.omnihack/vault/hermes_hub.db` (background build, never loaded in bulk).
+* **Progressive disclosure** — yellow-pages lookup scores category token sets,
+  then fetches only top categories with SQL `LIMIT`; `materialize()` returns
+  exactly one script/reference per sub-task (zero bloat).
+* **Cross-reference** — `XREF.cross_reference(skill_id, context)` fuses MCP
+  tool gateway hits, backend templates (`mcp_ai_agents`, `agent_skills`,
+  `always_on_agents`), GitHub repo templates (awesome-llm-apps family) and
+  historical execution stats from the memory vault.
+* **Closed learning loop** — completed multi-step runs (e.g. content
+  autopilot) are fused into custom skills, pass evaluation gates
+  (≥2 ok steps · valid refs · bloat caps · dedup) and persist to
+  `~/.hermes/skills/`.
+* **120 s sync daemon** — flushes cross-referenced execution data into the
+  DBAL on the mission heartbeat. Telegram: `/xref [query]`.
+
+```bash
+python3 -m mission_control.core.cross_ref_engine video render   # probe
+```
+
+## 🧩 Modular Backend Integration (zero UI touch)
+
+* **MCP Bridge** (`core/mcp_bridge.py`) — 8 MCP servers (filesystem, git,
+  github, sql, http, memory, browser, shell) with typed tool specs, param
+  validation, destructive-pattern sandbox guard and gateway export for the
+  Hermes tool layer.
+* **Skill Loader** (`core/skill_loader.py`) — hot-reloads evolved skills from
+  `~/.hermes/skills/` through loading gates; `pull_skill()` serves agents
+  on-demand (token match × confidence); `feedback()` closes the
+  self-improvement loop (confidence grows/decays, retirement at < 0.15) in
+  the DBAL ledger.
+* **Daemon Runner** (`core/daemon_runner.py`) — always-on agents
+  (telemetry-watchdog, release-radar, vault-integrity) on one scheduler
+  thread; logs + artifacts land in `~/.omnihack/vault/daemons.db` and are
+  flushed on the 120 s heartbeat — main thread stays free.
+* **External mount** (`external_tools/awesome-llm-apps/`) — reference-mode
+  starter catalogue (10 templates) + `StarterRPC.list/query/run` via the
+  `external_tools` shim.
+
+```bash
+python3 audit_handlers.py        # 325 backend handler checks (0 failures)
+```
+
+## 🐝 Zero-Cost Swarm + ⚙️ C99 Engine
+
+* **Lookup grid** (`core/lookup_swarm.py`) — 100 352 offline-compressed
+  personas (256 niches × 392) in SQLite, built lazily in the background.
+  Social daemons (Facebook · SoundCloud · X · Telegram) answer via an
+  FTS5 dialogue bank: **zero live model calls**, µs-latency lookups.
+* **C99 inference bridge** (`c99/omni_c99.c` + `core/c99_bridge.py`) —
+  compiled to a shared lib on first run (`cc -std=c99 -O2 -shared -fPIC`,
+  cached in `~/.omnihack/c99/`); routing, scoring and micro text generation
+  on plain CPU cores. Identical pure-Python fallback when no compiler
+  exists (parity-verified in the audit).
+* **Vita threads** — per-platform conversation state machines; active
+  threads + hit-rate visualised live in the **🐝 Zero-Cost Swarm** tab.
+* **DBAL link** — hit log + C99 inference log snapshotted on the 120 s
+  heartbeat; `lookup-swarm-keeper` runs as an always-on daemon.
+
+## 📈 TimesFM-Lite + 🧬 Quantum Agents
+
+* **TimesFM rebuilt from scratch** (`core/timesfm.py`, pure NumPy) — input
+  patching + zero-shot ensemble (seasonal-naive, Holt, Holt-Winters, Theta,
+  patch-attention) with per-call backtest weighting, p10/p50/p90 quantiles.
+  Feeds: hardware-matrix forecasts (CPU/RAM), 100k-user traffic forecasts
+  (lookup-swarm hit log), and **predictive GPU render-farm control**
+  (`renderfarm_advice()` → container pre-warm recommendation).
+* **Quantum anomaly pipeline** (`core/quantum_agents.py`) — PennyLane-style
+  statevector simulator (angle encoding → RY layers → ring-CNOT
+  entanglement → ⟨Z⟩ measurement) + QWEN3-14B-ORCH agent stub: verdicts
+  (NOMINAL/DRIFT/ANOMALY) + actions for hardware matrix and swarm traffic.
+* **Integration** — `forecast-quantum-watch` always-on daemon (120 s),
+  DBAL ledgers (`timesfm.db`, `quantum.db`), Telegram `/forecast` & `/quant`.
+
+## 🌍 Billion Grid (1e9 agents · 0 model calls)
+
+`core/billion_grid.py` — a simulated 235B teacher distilled once, offline,
+into a compact behavioural artifact: 4 096 quantised archetype lanes + the
+shared dialogue bank + a 1 000-cluster routing lattice.
+
+* **O(1) addressing** — a persona is just an integer; the resolver maps
+  `persona_id → traits → reply` deterministically (zero stored rows, zero
+  live model calls).
+* **Sparse activation ledger** — only activated personas occupy SQLite rows,
+  so the on-disk footprint stays in KB while 10⁹ agents remain addressable
+  (< 1 byte/persona distilled, ~10⁶× vs naive full cards).
+* `benchmark()` proves throughput (lookups/s, µs/op). Telegram: `/billion`.
+
+## 🎖️ Compute-Commander
+
+`core/compute_commander.py` — autonomous HPC offload sub-agent:
+
+* **cc-7b neural brain** (deterministic tool-execution parser on the C99
+  engine): natural-language commands → structured infra actions
+  (allocate/shift/power/scale/rebalance/status).
+* **Interception middleware** — heavy tasks (render/scrape/tune/embed,
+  weight ≥ 55) are diverted from local cores to the remote pool (Kaggle
+  free-tier GPUs, Colab T4, cloud spot pools, CPU farm); light tasks stay
+  local. The content pipeline's FFmpeg stage is wired through it.
+* **Bidirectional RPC** — power on/off/restart/scale per node; Hardware Hub
+  UI got a dedicated **commander chat channel** + remote pool control panel.
+* **Telemetry bridge** — 120 s `compute-commander-watch` daemon syncs
+  load/temp/power of every node into the DBAL (`compute.db`). Telegram:
+  `/compute [command]`.
+
+## 🖼️ Stream Wall + Stream Bridge
+
+* **Stream Bridge** (`core/stream_bridge.py`) — control plane for every
+  sub-agent notebook / Jupyter / Colab / browser-use session: attach/detach,
+  focus, WS-binary frame feed with compressed-size estimates, bidirectional
+  injection (click/key/scroll with ack latency) and an event ledger in
+  `streams.db`.
+* **Quad-Grid UI** — the 🖼️ Stream Wall tab renders four live thumbnail
+  cards (session ID · FPS · stealth profile · CPU/GPU) with click-to-expand
+  into the 30 FPS replica viewport + PiP strip.
+* **FPS performance guard** — focused stream runs 30 FPS, background cards
+  2–5 FPS, total budget 45 FPS enforced by `throttle_cycle()`; the
+  `stream-bridge-guard` daemon syncs telemetry every 120 s. Telegram:
+  `/streams`.
+
+## 🛠️ Hermes Core Init + 🔗 Model Binding
+
+* **Pre-flight CLI** (`hermes_core_init.py`, repo root) — verifies Python
+  runtime, dependencies, SQLite/FTS5, vault writability, core modules,
+  model binding and gateway hooks; exits non-zero on any failed item.
+  `--bind <local|openrouter|custom> [model] [endpoint] [KEY_ENV]` writes
+  the primary reasoning engine to `~/.hermes/config.json`
+  (`--status` shows the current binding).
+* Providers: **local** (Ollama, live socket probe on 11434), **openrouter**
+  and **custom** (any OpenAI-compatible base URL). API keys are referenced
+  via env-var names only and never persisted. The script deliberately does
+  **not** touch antivirus/OS security settings — configure exclusions
+  manually through your OS security UI after verifying checksums.
+
+## 🗄️ DBAL + 🫀 120 s Sync Heartbeat
+
+* **DBAL** (`core/dbal_engine.py`) — one registry over the local SQLite
+  vaults (`omni_memory.db` + `~/.omnihack/vault/*.db`, auto-discovered at
+  runtime) and external SQL endpoints (PostgreSQL/MySQL/Supabase/Neon,
+  registered by connection string; without drivers the link stays
+  *registered-simulated*). Auto-schema discovery via `PRAGMA`, idempotent
+  migration DDL generator with a migrations ledger, SELECT-only local
+  query window, passwords masked in the registry.
+* **Sync Heartbeat** (`core/sync_heartbeat.py`) — background worker that
+  collects memory / cross-ref / lookup / billion / compute / streams / DBAL
+  telemetry every **120 s**, persists one consolidated row to
+  `heartbeat_sync` and keeps the last 512 events in a bounded circular
+  **LogRing** (no files, no growth). The `dbal-heartbeat-sync` daemon
+  watchdogs the worker. Telegram: `/dbal`.
+
+## 🧭 Prompt Router (master → minion prompt DB)
+
+* `core/prompt_router.py` — dispatch database so the OMNI master hands
+  every minion the best-fit prompt: token-overlap routing × learned
+  quality factor, dispatch receipts in `prompt_db.db`, `feedback()` tunes
+  template weights. Seeded with **own clean templates** (social, scrape,
+  browser, render, code-fix, research, API, telemetry) — no third-party
+  or leaked prompt material. Telegram: `/prompt <task>` · `/model`.
+
+## 🧱 Architecture
+
+```
+mission_control/
+├── app.py                  # FastAPI host: / + /ops + /wall (uvicorn)
+├── core/                   # state, swarm, ollama, browser, ssh, pipeline,
+│                           # skills, memory, api_nexus, persistence,
+│                           # telegram_bridge, theme
+├── ui/                     # topbar + 11 tabs + screens.py (multi-monitor)
+└── data/                   # runtime vaults (git-ignored)
+```
