+   format validation, health bookkeeping, automatic rotation).
+✅ Catalogues genuinely free / keyless public API endpoints so agents can
+   work at zero cost without touching anyone else's credentials.
+✅ Ingests operator-supplied API directories (OpenAPI specs / JSON lists)
+   and extracts ENDPOINT metadata — never credentials.
+✅ Defensive leak scanner for the operator's OWN files: detects secrets,
+   reports them for revocation, never stores or uses them.
+✅ Adaptive learning curve per source + 120 s health-check heartbeat that
+   matches the central mission heartbeat + RPC facade for the swarm.
+
+🚫 It does NOT harvest other people's leaked keys and it does NOT consume
+   credentials that were not supplied by the operator.  Keys entering the
+   vault must carry ``provenance='operator'`` — anything else is refused.
